     On success, function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ddiirreeccttoorryy__ddeeccll() returns the index value
     generated for the directory.  In case of an error, function
     ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ddiirreeccttoorryy__ddeeccll() returns DW_DLV_NOCOUNT and sets the argument
     _e_r_r.

