     Function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ddiirreeccttoorryy__ddeeccll() can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  Either of the arguments _d_b_g or _n_a_m_e was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_MEMORY]    An out of memory condition was encountered during the
                        execution of the function.

